--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data redistributed in this repository
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The files under data/returns/ are derived from daily series published by the
Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis (FRED), https://fred.stlouisfed.org/.
Raw vendor payloads are not redistributed; the committed files are derived
level series, and scripts/fetch_data.py reproduces them from source.

FRED aggregates series from publishers whose terms differ:

  DGS2, DGS10, DGS30        Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System
                            (H.15 Selected Interest Rates).
                            US Government work, public domain.

  DTWEXBGS, DEXUSEU         Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System
                            (H.10 Foreign Exchange Rates).
                            US Government work, public domain.

  DCOILWTICO                U.S. Energy Information Administration.
                            US Government work, public domain.

  SP500, DJIA               S&P Dow Jones Indices LLC.
                            Copyright (c) S&P Dow Jones Indices LLC.
                            Redistribution and reproduction are restricted;
                            see the terms on the corresponding FRED series
                            page before redistributing.

  NASDAQ100                 Nasdaq OMX Group.
                            Redistribution restricted; see the terms on the
                            corresponding FRED series page.

  DAAA, DBAA                Moody's.
                            Redistribution restricted; see the terms on the
                            corresponding FRED series page.

